    <help>
      <title>Jaguar</title>
      <key>
        <name>d</name>
        <desc>Open/Close canopy</desc>
      </key>
	   <key>
        <name>]</name>
        <desc>Start/Stop engines</desc>
      </key>
	   <key>
        <name>w</name>
        <desc>Weapons mode</desc>
      </key>
	   <key>
        <name>e</name>
        <desc>Fire guns</desc>
      </key>
	  <key>
        <name>q</name>
        <desc>Toggle Radar standby</desc>
      </key>
	   <key>
        <name>T</name>
        <desc>Toggle RWR</desc>
      </key>
      <key>
        <name>t</name>
        <desc>Change Radar Distances (10, 20 40)</desc>
      </key>
      <key>
        <name>R</name>
        <desc>Activate/desactivate targeting the nearest</desc>
      </key>
	   <key>
        <name>n</name>
        <desc>Next Target</desc>
      </key>

	   <key>
        <name>o/O</name>
        <desc>Toggle tailhook</desc>
      </key>
      <key>
        <name>Ctrl-n</name>
        <desc>Previous Target</desc>
      </key>
      <key>
        <name>u</name>
        <desc>Toggle Refueling Probe</desc>
      </key>
      <line>Afterburners engage when</line>
      <line>throttle moves past 75%</line>
	  <line>Hard manouvering at speeds over 450kt may result in</line>
      <line>unexpected pitch behaviour.</line>
	  <line>Exceeding 8.5g or Lowering flaps or gear at 275kts+ may result in damage.</line>
      <line>Cannons carry 150 rounds each. These can be reloaded  while on the ground by using the Jaguar menu.</line>
	  <line>Droptanks will automatically switch when empty.</line>
      <line>Takeoff with one click on the flaps at</line>
	  <line>170 - 210 kt depending on payload.</line>
      <line></line>
    </help>

   <multiplay>
      <chat_display>1</chat_display>
      <generic>
        <!-- Nav lights on -->
		  <int n="0" alias="/controls/switches/nav-lights-switch" />
